        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor White\n    BorderColor Black\n    BorderThickness 1.5\n}\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor White\n    BorderColor Black\n    Shadowing false\n}\nskinparam hexagon {\n    BackgroundColor White\n    BorderColor Black\n    BorderThickness 1.5\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\n\n&#39; === THỰC THỂ (ENTITIES) ===\nrectangle \&quot;TAI_KHOAN\&quot; as TK\nrectangle \&quot;SU_CO\&quot; as SC\nrectangle \&quot;PHIEU_PHAN_CONG\&quot; as PPC\nrectangle \&quot;TO_DOI\&quot; as TD\nrectangle \&quot;LOAI_SU_CO\&quot; as LSC\n\n&#39; === MỐI QUAN HỆ (RELATIONSHIPS) ===\nhexagon \&quot;Lập\&quot; as Rel_Lap\nhexagon \&quot;Thuộc loại\&quot; as Rel_Loai\nhexagon \&quot;Nhận\&quot; as Rel_Nhan\nhexagon \&quot;Phát sinh\&quot; as Rel_Sinh\n\n&#39; === THUỘC TÍNH (ATTRIBUTES) ===\n&#39; 1. Tài khoản\nusecase \&quot;MaTaiKhoan\&quot; as TK_Ma\nusecase \&quot;HoTen\&quot; as TK_Ten\nusecase \&quot;QuyenHan\&quot; as TK_Quyen\nTK -- TK_Ma\nTK -- TK_Ten\nTK -- TK_Quyen\n\n&#39; 2. Sự cố\nusecase \&quot;MaSuCo\&quot; as SC_Ma\nusecase \&quot;DiaChi\&quot; as SC_DiaChi\nusecase \&quot;( NguoiBao )\&quot; as SC_NguoiBao\nusecase \&quot;HoTenNB\&quot; as SC_HT\nusecase \&quot;SDT_NB\&quot; as SC_SDT\nSC -- SC_Ma\nSC -- SC_DiaChi\nSC -- SC_NguoiBao\nSC_NguoiBao -- SC_HT\nSC_NguoiBao -- SC_SDT\n\n&#39; 3. Tổ đội \nusecase \&quot;MaToDoi\&quot; as TD_Ma\nusecase \&quot;TenToDoi\&quot; as TD_Ten\nusecase \&quot;SoDienThoai\&quot; as TD_SDT\nTD -- TD_Ma\nTD -- TD_Ten\nTD -- TD_SDT\n\n&#39; 4. Phiếu phân công\nusecase \&quot;MaPhieu\&quot; as PPC_Ma\nusecase \&quot;NgayLap\&quot; as PPC_Ngay\nusecase \&quot;ThoiHan\&quot; as PPC_Han\nPPC -- PPC_Ma\nPPC -- PPC_Ngay\nPPC -- PPC_Han\n\n&#39; 5. Loại sự cố\nusecase \&quot;MaLoai\&quot; as LSC_Ma\nusecase \&quot;TenLoai\&quot; as LSC_Ten\nLSC -- LSC_Ma\nLSC -- LSC_Ten\n\n&#39; === LIÊN KẾT &amp; BẢN SỐ (ĐÃ FIX LỖI CHO DRAW.IO) ===\nTK -- Rel_Lap : 1\nRel_Lap -- PPC : N\n\nSC -- Rel_Sinh : 1\nRel_Sinh -- PPC : 1\n\nTD -- Rel_Nhan : 1\nRel_Nhan -- PPC : N\n\nLSC -- Rel_Loai : 1\nRel_Loai -- SC : N\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="axwdGtJkH3ixUaQQOND9-2">
